FSL's standard images in larmorx-nc
===================================

This directory holds three files of FSL's standard-space data, copied byte for byte from FSL
6.0.7.23's data package fsl-data_standard 2208.0 (FSL's conda channel,
https://fsl.fmrib.ox.ac.uk/fsldownloads/fslconda/public/noarch/fsl-data_standard-2208.0-0.tar.bz2,
SHA-256 2faefb4d366b6427cbf4e5c3e54c63c040ec9bcfe11b1f10848f89a1571b828a), where they are
${FSLDIR}/data/standard/<file>. MANIFEST.tsv lists each file, its size and its SHA-256. They are
the images FSL's bet script (its options -S, -B, -A, -A2) and standard_space_roi read, and
larmorx-nc's replicas of those scripts read them from here when no FSL installation is given.

